      "description": "A single apparatus has a left upright and a right upright, each terminating in a collar and a spreading three-foot base. A long horizontal rail crosses both uprights, with dark clamps at the intersections. Another clamp fixes the left spring at the left upright. The right upright carries the rope pulley below its rail clamp.",
